<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Tandy FY96 estimate trimmed.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Tandy FY96 estimate trimmed.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities Inc said Friday it had cut its fiscal 1996 earnings estimate on Tandy Corp to $3.13 a share from $3.15.</p>
<p>-- In a report, EVEREN noted that Tandy's August combined comparable-store sales declined one percent.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Beth Richard said in a report that she maintains her outperform rating on the company for both the intermediate and long term.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
